Upcoming African Events in QLD African Fashion Show![africanfashionshowimage](/media/2014/07/africanfashionshowimage-1.jpg) FOLLOWING THE SUCCESS OF THE SUMMER FASHION SHOW, A+ IS PROUD TO HOST THE 2014 WINTER AFRICAN FASHION SHOW THIS JULY AND INVITE EVERYONE TO JOIN THEM FOR AN ENTERTAINING AND INSPIRING NIGHT, ON WHICH INFUSED CONTEMPORARY AFRICAN DESIGNS BY UP AND COMING AFRICAN FASHION DESIGNERS WILL BE SHOWCASED. THE EVENING INCLUDES LIVE MUSICAL ENTERTAINMENT AND LIGHT REFRESHMENTS. THEME: ALL BLACK (to keep you warm) EVENT DETAILS: DATE: Saturday, July 12 TIME: From 6:00 P.M. t0 9:00 P.M. VENUE: Lightspace Brisbane, 30 Light St Fortitude Valley, Brisbane, Queensland, Australia 4006 TICKET PRICE: $ 35.00 until 10 July 2014, after which price will change. TICKETS AVAILABLE FROM: [https://www.stickytickets.com.au/16948/african\_fashion\_show\_.aspx](https://www.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.stickytickets.com.au%2F16948%2Fafrican_fashion_show_.aspx&h=zAQFDWnaI&enc=AZPsDBiDEzhsdMt9099w5b7tAoKqqnUnc8m9kz6dmrl5goU_DUCEturDyIepGM-lTUjuIQmz_yZ6IcRjnc3KStD5zM3vxxrPV6Y4aJX9nNk5PqO4O80x6pYOwAPyWMJLXTm7CmuiqEUl3-dY_ICQLeprESm81dO2TKEhFYacS8MwOg&s=1&skip_shim_verification=1) FOR FURTHER INFORMATION PLEASE CONTACT: >Samsun: 0468 471 416... >Raisa: 0402 184 703 > Geoff: 0401 182 024
